; Touch-interface lines to MERGE into the [/Script/Engine.InputSettings] section of a mock project's
; Config/DefaultInput.ini (do not create a second section header if one exists). No placeholders.
; The engine's default virtual joystick gives a left-thumb stick: the one-thumb walk.
[/Script/Engine.InputSettings]
DefaultTouchInterface=/Engine/MobileResources/HUD/DefaultVirtualJoysticks.DefaultVirtualJoysticks
bAlwaysShowTouchInterface=False
bShowConsoleOnFourFingerTap=False
bUseMouseForTouch=False
